OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine on offer this
OL,7,Fevening, leading to a dry and mostly
OL,8,Fclear night. Under clear skies
OL,9,Ftemperatures will be allow to fall
OL,10,Faway, with a rural frost possible.
OL,11,FSome patchy mist or fog may form near
OL,12,Fdawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FAnother chilly, bright start
OL,15,Fwith plenty of sunshine on Sunday.
OL,16,FSome patchy cloud through the
OL,17,Fafternoon may lead to a very isolated
OL,18,Flight shower. Temperatures around
OL,19,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
