OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FShowers, some perhaps heavy, move
OL,7,Fwestwards across the region on Monday.
OL,8,FFurther rain at times into Tuesday and
OL,9,FWednesday, and possibly turning windy
OL,10,Flater. Temperatures around, or
OL,11,Fslightly above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
